    "mainIdea": {
      "text": "When a magic gourd pulled Summer, Ms. Lin, Grandpa, and the seven brothers into the Reverse Valley, they discovered that strength alone could not open the shrinking exit. The valley turned each brother's power into a colored mark only after that power helped a companion. Big Brother supported a bridge, Second Brother found a safe route, and Third Brother blocked danger. Fourth and Fifth Brothers controlled fire and water, while Sixth Brother rescued Grandpa from a thorny platform. Seventh Brother changed the gourd from a tool for capturing others into a tool that returned the final marks. With Summer observing the team, Ms. Lin organizing their steps, and Grandpa explaining the carved order, the brothers placed all seven marks correctly. Their cooperation opened the gate, brought everyone home, and ended the Snake Spirit's spell."
    },
